!*.*
!*/

tests/**/target
tests/**/Cargo.lock
# Rust crates the translator generates for the packages a fixture imports.
# Every run rebuilds them from scratch, they differ by platform, and they are
# most of what the translator writes: tracking them made every translator
# change a diff of thousands of files. The fixture's own main.rs and
# Cargo.toml stay tracked.
tests/**/vendor/**/*.rs
tests/**/vendor/**/Cargo.toml
.worktrees/
!Brewfile
